Subject: [x11-reparented-client-fallback] Find ICCCM clients below frames when EWMH lists are absent

ICCCM 4.1.3.1 requires recursive WM_STATE search for reparented top-level
clients. Retain present-empty EWMH authority and existing mapped-root fallback.
Reference: https://xorg.freedesktop.org/archive/current/doc/xorg-docs/icccm/icccm.html

